<http://example.org/thinkr#hasEarthSystemsXPosition> a owl:DatatypeProperty .

<http://example.org/thinkr#hasEarthSystemsYPosition> a owl:DatatypeProperty .

<http://example.org/thinkr#hasEconomicXPosition> a owl:DatatypeProperty .

